<h1>PDF Report Generation</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If Pdf995 generates 0 byte PDF files:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet">If you are on Microsoft Windows XP or 2000 Professional make sure you have read/write privileges to the pdf995 folder.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet">Set the documents in the Pdf995 printer queue for deletion and reboot.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">If still fails, add TS Enabled=0 to the Parameters section of</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>C:\Program Files\pdf995\res\pdf995.ini</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and reboot. Note: this will disable support for Citrix server.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet">&#160;</p>
